{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>愛樂維兒童液體鈣30包裝（Elevit Kids Liquid Calcium）邊度買平？新假期整理屈臣氏、萬寧及HKTVmall共3間零售商的網店報價。以同款單盒標價計，最低與次低相差HK$93.5，約22%。</p>\n<h2>愛樂維兒童液體鈣30包裝各網店報價</h2>\n<table>\n<thead></thead>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>零售商</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒標價</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒總額</strong></th>\n<th><strong>計價條件</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最低已核實｜HKTVmall</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$325.5</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$325.5</strong></td>\n<td><strong>單盒標價</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屈臣氏</td>\n<td>HK$419</td>\n<td>HK$419</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>萬寧</td>\n<td>HK$419</td>\n<td>HK$419</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>愛樂維兒童液體鈣30包裝單盒價錢點計？</h2>\n<p>買一盒愛樂維兒童液體鈣30包裝，HKTVmall的同款網上標價為HK$325.5，較表列次低標價HK$419少HK$93.5。愛樂維兒童液體鈣30包裝這個價差以單盒商品標價比較。若打算買多件，宜另計商戶的購買條件及結帳價。</p>\n<p>以上為2026年11月28日商戶網上報價，未計運費，價格、優惠及供應以商戶為準。網店來源：<a href=\"https://www.watsons.com.hk/zh-hk/%E6%84%9B%E6%A8%82%E7%B6%AD-%E6%84%9B%E6%A8%82%E7%B6%AD%C2%AE%E5%85%92%E7%AB%A5%E6%B6%B2%E9%AB%94%E9%88%A3/p/BP_824892\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">屈臣氏</a><a href=\"https://www.mannings.com.hk/zh-hant/elevit-kids-liquid-calcium-30-sachets/p/138032\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬寧</a><a href=\"https://www.hktvmall.com/hktv/zh/main/%E6%8B%9C%E8%80%B3%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%97%97%E8%89%A6%E5%BA%97/s/H1179001/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5%E7%94%A2%E5%93%81/%E5%85%92%E7%AB%A5%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7/%E5%85%92%E7%AB%A5%E6%B6%B2%E9%AB%94%E9%88%A3/p/H0888001_S_10167981\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">HKTVmall</a></p>\n<p>這款蘋果味液體配方含檸檬酸鈣及維他命D3。鈣是骨骼的主要成分之一，維他命D有助身體吸收鈣。如對成分或服用有疑問，建議先諮詢醫生或其他合資格的醫護專業人士。<a href=\"https://ods.od.nih.gov/factsheets/Calcium-Consumer/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIH：鈣的消費者資料</a></p>\n<p>本次以（HK$419－HK$325.5）÷HK$419×100%計，約22%。計算方法：（較高標價－較低標價）÷較高標價×100%。上述比例未計運費及額外活動，亦不代表全港最低價、歷史低價或不同包裝版本的配方已完全核實一致。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179583940714015054_3967244146b0a55afe7996.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛樂維兒童液體鈣30包裝格價\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179583940714015054_3967244146b0a55afe7996.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>點樣先可以用圖中價格買到愛樂維兒童液體鈣30包裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>以2026年11月28日網上報價，HKTVmall的單盒商品總額為HK$325.5。條件為單盒標價，未計運費。</p>\n<p>今次格價比較哪一款包裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>比較的是兒童配方，每盒30包。萬寧所列成分包括大豆油，有食物過敏的家庭宜先查閱包裝。</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T04:23:57.035843+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":761,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T04:16:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T04:57:25.005433+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T04:17:27.732642+00:00","content_hash":"af4372cea919b730349e25923ca4f6f36035816bedf2b446974ea841e5d43d63","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}